---
id: journey_flotilla_patrol
title: Flotilla Patrol
tags: [interaction, military]
context: journey
weight: 8
cooldown: 5
---

=== intro

A military signature appears on sensors—Argent Flotilla 
configuration. They're running patrol patterns, sweeping 
for threats.

When they notice you, a hail comes through. Professional. 
Clipped.

"Civilian vessel, identify yourself and state your cargo. 
This is a security zone."

* [Comply with identification]
  -> comply

* [Ask why this is a security zone]
  -> ask

* [Try to slip away quietly]
  ~ fuel -= 5
  -> slip

=== comply

You transmit your registration and manifest. The patrol 
vessel processes, cross-references, returns a verdict.

"Blackwing. Free trader, no outstanding warrants. Cargo 
appears legitimate."

A pause. Then, almost friendly: "We've had Sera activity 
in this sector. Watch yourself."

* [Thank them and continue]
  ~ flag flotilla_friendly
  ~ chronicle "Flotilla Patrol"
    Encountered an Argent Flotilla patrol. They warned about Sera activity.
  -> END

* [Ask about the Sera activity]
  -> sera_info

=== ask

"Recent activity. A scouting element passed through two 
cycles ago. We drove them off, but where there's one, 
there's more."

The patrol vessel's signal carries the weight of too 
many battles.

"If you see anything—unusual energy signatures, ships 
that don't respond to hails—report it. We pay for 
good intelligence."

* [Offer to help]
  ~ flag flotilla_ally
  ~ chronicle "Flotilla Patrol"
    Offered to report Sera activity to the Flotilla. They appreciated it.
  -> END

* [Continue on your way]
  ~ chronicle "Flotilla Patrol"
    Encountered a Flotilla patrol in a Sera-active sector. Kept moving.
  -> END

=== slip

You cut your drive signature and drift, hoping to avoid 
attention. The patrol vessel continues its pattern, 
sensors sweeping...

And passes you by. Either they didn't notice, or they 
decided a silent freighter wasn't worth investigating.

* [Continue quietly]
  ~ chronicle "Flotilla Patrol"
    Avoided a Flotilla patrol. Probably nothing to hide, but didn't want the hassle.
  -> END

=== sera_info

"Breeding colony established itself on an automated 
station two sectors over. By the time we got there, 
they'd eaten through half the infrastructure."

The patrol commander's signal carries weary frustration.

"Three adults, maybe two dozen juveniles. Took us 
hours to clear them out. Damned things breed fast 
when they find good material to consume."

* [Sounds like a rough job]
  ~ integrity += 2
  ~ flag flotilla_friendly
  ~ chronicle "Flotilla Patrol"
    Heard about a Sera breeding colony from a Flotilla patrol. Pest control on a military scale.
  -> END
